NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000765 "  - Dan Brook       : PPIx::XPath, Acme::PerlML"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000766 "  - Audrey Tang     : \"Line Noise\" Testing"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000767 "  - Arjen Laarhoven : Three-element ->location support"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000768 "  - Elliot Shank    : Perl 5.10 support, five-element ->location"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000769 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000770 "And finally, thanks to those brave ( and foolish :) ) souls willing to dive"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000771 "in and use, test drive and provide feedback on PPI before version 1.000,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000772 "in some cases before it made it to beta quality, and still did extremely"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000773 "distasteful things (like eating 50 meg of RAM a second)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000774 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000775 "I owe you all a beer. Corner me somewhere and collect at your convenience."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000776 "If I missed someone who wasn't in my email history, thank you too :)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000777 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000778 "  # In approximate order of appearance"
