NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000801 "  - Johnny Lee"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000802 "  - Johan Lindstrom"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000803 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000804 "And to single one person out, thanks go to Randal Schwartz who"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000805 "spent a great number of hours in IRC over a critical 6 month period"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000806 "explaining why Perl is impossibly unparsable and constantly shoving evil"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000807 "and ugly corner cases in my face. He remained a tireless devil's advocate,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000808 "and without his support this project genuinely could never have been"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000809 "completed."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000810 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000811 "So for my schooling in the Deep Magiks, you have my deepest gratitude Randal."
